<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-31T18:40:50.875Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:40:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Army drones have struck displaced persons camps in Amhara, killing civilians including children, while a separate drone strike in Tigray killed civilians collecting grain. The prime minister placed senior officials in military training at a centre in Hurso. Sudan has accused Ethiopia of supplying RSF with arms and of using Assosa airport as a launch base for RSF drones. Two attacks four days apart in Oromia killed 60 Orthodox Christians. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxObWxFck1EbEF1MjVtOFo5RFpsbHh0TFJDa251X2pPeEtISEI4UDVRZzR2ME5qS2NyRWw2Zi0wVWlUTkFIRVZ0d3JoanhFc3MzdlMtWlJaRTh1amh6cng0S0lDOFlvY2VUWDNabFpQaUl4clVLY0pHUXM0bzJZRzhJSzB3RmhiTE81eURZQUEzQzRKRzhSUjV4UFBVcmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOaHplMjNLc3pvNG5MRnBDcXdpQW92T2tHZkVLNjh4UDFXUUJkWHBoWUdYUzhpXzVJVHhNNGJDbjZ3cU12VzF5aWQzVWhESFJRNmZoNE45WV9vWENLYkhSdjBYYklrcWI1eFdyX09sVktnWlRwaU04X3VlTXZuMnV3U1ljWG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPc0kwS25tV2UzOVE4OUdDYTQ2aTNUbnBzM1M3NktCOTR4cFFkSzJWZkpCTmRSYU9TRnp5U1hqRHpxM240OG0yd2NHeTdjQm9QbHVYVXVLU0V1cDhOZzJGQjBKZHZaaERxbU5McWlUNF9VVVlOalk3TGplblRTbGhVU3ZyR2xFY2hTQjRPdGRYLW5Kc3QxTHpCRGtvOFNBaWtMdnpj?oc=5&quot;&gt;News of Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9sX2tjOFVTNlJ3U3U1dzUyT0VSNUVMTWhuTGx3b29QenN6NXZsQV9RazdDRWJ3ZX